      "description": "Fixed blue metric bar with tabular values and explicit pause and exit actions.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-toolbar\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Drill status\"><b>Precision</b><div class=\"ds-metrics\"><span><small>TIME</small><b>0:30</b></span><span><small>SCORE</small><b>0</b></span><span><small>ACCURACY</small><b>—</b></span></div><div class=\"ds-toolbar-actions\"><button>Pause</button><button>Exit</button></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-toolbar{box-sizing:border-box;height:80px;padding:12px 26px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:25px;background:#101a2b;border-bottom:1px solid #26364d;color:#eef5ff;font:400 14px/1.5 Inter,Arial,sans-serif}.ds-toolbar>b{width:180px;font-size:14px;font-weight:500}.ds-metrics{display:flex;gap:48px}.ds-metrics span{text-align:center;min-width:65px}.ds-metrics small{font-size:9px;color:#9aaec8;letter-spacing:.07em;display:block;margin-bottom:2px}.ds-metrics b{display:block;font-size:24px;font-weight:500;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;line-height:1.2}.ds-toolbar-actions{width:180px;display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:20px}.ds-toolbar-actions button{font:400 12px/1.5 Inter,Arial,sans-serif;color:#b4c5dc;min-height:44px;padding:9px 5px;background:none;border:0;cursor:pointer}.ds-toolbar-actions button:hover{color:#eef5ff}.ds-toolbar-actions button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent-text,#ffab8b);outline-offset:4px;}@media(max-width:720px){.ds-toolbar{height:90px;padding:10px 15px;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:2px}.ds-toolbar>b{width:auto;flex:1;order:1;font-size:12px}.ds-toolbar-actions{width:auto;order:2;gap:15px}.ds-toolbar-actions button{font-size:11px;min-height:32px;padding-block:5px}.ds-metrics{width:100%;order:3;gap:35px;justify-content:center}.ds-metrics small{font-size:8px;margin:0}.ds-metrics b{font-size:21px}.ds-metrics span{min-width:60px}}"
